    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>8级 杂兵 护卫</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 自然界 野兽</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 1；失手攻击无法伤害杂兵</span><span>''先攻'' +9</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 24，''强韧'' 21，''反射'' 20，''意志'' 19</span><span>''侦查'' +6</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 8</span><span>''感官'' 昏暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}狩猎者✦灵气 1</div>\n<div class=description>任何在该灵气内的敌人提供战斗优势。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+13vs.AC<br>命中：8 点伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}野蛮反应✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>触发：一个邻接该鬣狗的敌人进行一次目标不包括该鬣狗的攻击。<br>效果（直觉反应）：该鬣狗对触发的敌人使用啮咬。</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 20（+9）</span><span>''敏捷'' 17（+7）</span><span>''感知'' 15（+6）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 16（+7）</span><span>''智力'' 2（+0）</span><span>''魅力'' 5（+1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 无</span></div></div>\n</div>",
